“Consent Manager” means a person registered with the Board, who acts as a single point of
contact to enable a Data Principal to give, manage, review and withdraw her consent through an
accessible, transparent and interoperable platform;

“data” means a representation of information, facts, concepts, opinions or instructions in a
manner suitable for communication, interpretation or processing by human beings or by automated
means;

a person with disability, includes her lawful guardian, acting on her behalf;
